WEBVTT

00:00:05.384 --> 00:00:07.473
I'm moving.

00:00:08.256 --> 00:00:09.867
I'm moving!

00:00:13.044 --> 00:00:15.481
You go get it, grandson!

00:00:16.221 --> 00:00:17.265
Hey!

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:19.267
Oh, whoa, whoa...

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.663
No. No, no!

00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:25.970
I'm almost there!

00:00:28.799 --> 00:00:29.582
Whoa!

00:00:29.756 --> 00:00:31.149
[groaning]

00:00:34.761 --> 00:00:36.328
Sonic!

00:00:42.769 --> 00:00:45.467
[gasps][all yelling, grunting]

00:00:45.641 --> 00:00:46.512
[heavy grunt]

00:00:47.905 --> 00:00:49.210
[yells]

00:00:49.384 --> 00:00:51.735
That was so not worth it!

00:00:52.736 --> 00:00:53.867
Ooh!

00:00:57.001 --> 00:00:58.742
- You okay?
- Yeah. You good?

00:00:58.916 --> 00:00:59.655
Sonic!

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.657
[Tom] Hey.[groaning]

00:01:01.832 --> 00:01:05.052
Sonic, one,
concrete boulder, zero.

00:01:05.226 --> 00:01:06.184
[sighing]

00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:07.663
Thanks for the save.

00:01:07.838 --> 00:01:09.361
Cutting it a little close,
don't you think?

00:01:10.797 --> 00:01:12.146
Secure the room!

00:01:14.148 --> 00:01:15.367
She's got the key.

00:01:18.109 --> 00:01:19.197
I got an idea.

00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:29.860
Commander Walters.

00:01:30.034 --> 00:01:31.122
Sir.

00:01:31.296 --> 00:01:32.906
You're... Still alive?

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.866
I'll die before I let that key
fall into the wrong hands.

00:01:36.736 --> 00:01:38.129
Thanks for keeping it safe.

00:01:38.303 --> 00:01:39.783
I'll take it from here.

00:01:42.481 --> 00:01:44.309
That's an order,
Director Rockwell.

00:01:48.008 --> 00:01:50.663
Now, organize
the reinforcements.

00:01:52.012 --> 00:01:53.100
Yes, sir.

00:01:58.845 --> 00:02:01.065
Guys, guys, I got the key.
I repeat, I got the key.

00:02:01.239 --> 00:02:02.849
Now let's get out of here.

00:02:07.071 --> 00:02:09.334
Commander Walters.

00:02:09.508 --> 00:02:11.205
No, no. No. Wait!

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:26.917
What?

00:02:27.091 --> 00:02:29.615
Tom! Everyone's clear!
Come on, let's go!

00:02:29.789 --> 00:02:31.660
You. What are you--

00:02:33.358 --> 00:02:34.402
Tom!

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:37.579
Tom. Tom, what happened?

00:02:37.753 --> 00:02:39.277
Speak to me. Come on.

00:02:39.451 --> 00:02:41.627
Come on,
it's gonna be okay.

00:02:41.801 --> 00:02:44.848
Please, please, please get up.
Hey, come on, please wake up.

00:02:45.022 --> 00:02:46.632
Wake up, wake up, come on.

00:02:47.328 --> 00:02:48.721
Wake up, wake up, wake up!

00:02:49.417 --> 00:02:50.854
Maria.

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.598
What did you do?

00:02:58.818 --> 00:03:00.864
What I had to.

00:03:03.518 --> 00:03:05.216
Oh, my God. Tom!

00:03:08.436 --> 00:03:10.134
Help me up, kid.

00:03:10.308 --> 00:03:11.875
[grunting]

00:03:12.963 --> 00:03:14.268
Freeze! Don't move!

00:03:14.442 --> 00:03:19.317
Any tricks up your sleeve,
Captain Grandtastic?

00:03:19.491 --> 00:03:20.927
[soldiers grunting]

00:03:23.147 --> 00:03:24.365
[terrified yelp]

00:03:26.063 --> 00:03:28.108
We got what we came for.

00:03:28.848 --> 00:03:31.720
Great job, Shadow.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:35.333
We have both keys.

00:03:35.507 --> 00:03:38.292
So where's your little
science project?

00:03:39.685 --> 00:03:43.645
It's closer than you think,
my boy.

00:03:45.821 --> 00:03:47.345
Welcome...[yelps]

00:03:47.519 --> 00:03:50.870
...to my masterpiece!

00:03:53.786 --> 00:03:55.527
I must hand it to GUN.

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:59.139
They built her
to my exact specifications.

00:03:59.313 --> 00:04:00.488
It's...

00:04:02.142 --> 00:04:03.709
remarkable!

00:04:03.883 --> 00:04:05.102
Mm-hmm.

00:04:05.276 --> 00:04:08.105
- Astounding!
- Yes.

00:04:09.236 --> 00:04:11.369
That's my genius grand-genome!

00:04:11.543 --> 00:04:15.155
And I have one more surprise.

00:04:17.636 --> 00:04:21.640
It's a new suit!

00:04:25.383 --> 00:04:27.298
[giddy squealing]

00:04:28.864 --> 00:04:31.041
[excited grunting]

00:04:31.215 --> 00:04:32.042
Gee.

00:04:32.216 --> 00:04:33.826
[smooching]

00:04:34.522 --> 00:04:36.568
[grunting]

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:53.977
<i>♪ I'm a chip
Off the old block ♪</i>

00:04:54.151 --> 00:04:56.240
<i>♪ I'm a chip
Off the old block ♪</i>

00:04:56.414 --> 00:04:59.199
<i>♪ I'm a chip off
The old block!♪</i>

00:04:59.373 --> 00:05:00.679
[ring tone chiming]

00:05:00.853 --> 00:05:02.768
What do you want, Stone?
I'm busy.

00:05:02.942 --> 00:05:05.945
Doctor, I have a bad feeling
about this.

00:05:06.119 --> 00:05:09.079
I don't think your grandfather's
been completely honest with us.

00:05:09.253 --> 00:05:10.950
It was something Shadow said.

00:05:11.733 --> 00:05:12.952
<i>There's more to their plan.</i>

00:05:14.388 --> 00:05:17.435
How dare you!

00:05:17.609 --> 00:05:20.394
You have been jealous
of my long-lost grand-Pop-Tart

00:05:20.568 --> 00:05:22.701
since the very beginning!

00:05:22.875 --> 00:05:25.530
I no longer require
your obsequious groveling.

00:05:25.704 --> 00:05:28.185
<i>Consider this your notice
of termination.</i>

00:05:28.359 --> 00:05:31.753
Your letter of reference
will be L for Loser.

00:05:31.927 --> 00:05:33.755
Of course,
I'll expect you to stay on

00:05:33.929 --> 00:05:35.409
until you've been
successfully cloned.

00:05:35.583 --> 00:05:39.065
But you and I are done!

00:05:39.239 --> 00:05:41.676
Like a blackened
catfish dinner!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:45.115
Sir, it's too dangerous and
I'm not there to protect you.

00:05:45.289 --> 00:05:46.420
I already lost you once! I--

00:05:46.594 --> 00:05:48.727
Unsubscribe.
Blocked and reported.

00:05:49.945 --> 00:05:51.860
[breath shaking]
I can't lose you again.

00:05:53.775 --> 00:05:55.386
[sighs]

00:05:58.302 --> 00:05:59.868
Do the honors...

00:06:00.608 --> 00:06:01.783
grandson.

00:06:03.698 --> 00:06:05.004
Here we go.

